      "iri" : "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C29298",
      "lang" : "en",
      "description" : [ "Colloidal oatmeal, whole oats milled to a fine powder, with anti-pruritic activity. Oatmeal powder, especially when added to a warm bath, is used to provide temporary relief of itching and irritation caused by insect bites, eczema, sun burns, reactions to poisonous plants and various other skin rashes and allergies." ],
